    "current_example": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-4448",
      "problem": "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/10ea2188cefa5130784dda04650276ac7cb4c67ee28fb045cb2401e45a06b31c.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/88f6b7a6e9ce332698d4c42611b481ed5ced9818c1f430f72a7aef8ff2dcfa73.svg)\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14250940/assets/8dbebcb1ca123824f5d330b2dd0504848a945f1ffc518980e6ef26f9fced5f88.svg)\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{23} & =(-1)^{2+3}{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
